OL,3,ALammy urges Burnham to take UK back
OL,4,Ainto the EU
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Lammy has urged Andy Burnham to
OL,7,Ftake Labour into the next general
OL,8,Felection with a pledge to rejoin the
OL,9,FEuropean Union.
OL,11,FThe former deputy prime minister's
OL,12,Fintervention comes as Burnham prepares
OL,13,Fto reopen a debate on the long-term
OL,14,Frelationship with Europe in the wake of
OL,15,Fa summit in Brussels this Friday.
OL,17,FIt makes him the latest senior Labour
OL,18,Ffigure to publicly support a future
OL,19,Freversal of Brexit, after ex-chancellor
OL,20,FRachel Reeves said she believed
OL,21,FBritain's future lies in the bloc.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
